  "instructions": [
    "Heat the infuse oil in a large pan over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the curry powder and turmeric and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the dried blackeye peas, salt, and water, and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer for 20 minutes.",
    "Mash some of the blackeye peas to thicken the curry sauce.",
    "Serve hot over rice or with naan bread."
